From: J P <jpwatters@mac.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 10:28:10 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 14/35] tx-test: log each transmit burst on the relay and
 compare it with the Tab5 console

The relay writes txlog/txlog-<date>.log: every command it handed to the QMX
during a burst, timed on the NAS's monotonic clock, with RF on-air time, tone
gaps and symbol timing against schedule. tools/tx-test has a Mac capture of
the Tab5 console (Mac-time stamped, for slot pairing only) and tx_compare.py,
which pairs bursts by slot and compares only same-clock intervals.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
